      "widgets_values": [
        "# Individual — Cocktail (tested recipe)\n\nRTX 3090 / normal ComfyUI port 8188. Press Run on that worker.\nThe Base, Qwen, VAE and sampler nodes enforce this worker server-side. The 4070 and legacy --disable-dynamic-vram workers are rejected before any model-loading branch. Existing production workflows are unchanged.\n\nThis is the accepted RAW COCKTAIL recipe, not the public Individual preset implementation and not 14-scene approval. A fresh normal-3090 runtime check is tracked separately from the historical 4070 result; do not transfer the old timing to this worker.\n\nBase 9B FP8 + Qwen FP8mixed + full Flux2 VAE. Turbo 1 → Mitch V3 step1600 .90 → Smartphone .25. 8 Euler / CFG 1, 832×1216. Genuine front 448×592 → body 512×512 → angle09 432×576, in that order, on BOTH native reference-latent branches. The body-only wording is a prompt request, not hard identity isolation. No swap, mask, restoration, upscaler or second pass.\n\nThe prompt and seed are ordinary editable controls. Default seed315982047 is fixed for reproducibility; every press of Run samples again. A new prompt/seed is an UNVALIDATED variation, not a guarantee of likeness, closed lips, hands or arbitrary scenes. Preserve the three genuine reference roles/order/sizes. Exact default-input SHA256 values and source-graph provenance are in config/production-speed-solo-upgrade.json.\n\nReview the complete new image and likeness. For this scene check closed lips, slight image-left gaze, believable tumbler grip/railing contact, pocket hand, city lights/patrons and no face halo. Images save to production-speed/individual-cocktail; SaveImage increments filenames. Historical photos remain untouched.\n"
      ]
    }
